    {
      "text": "Forest plot of Nipro PZA LPA sensitivity and specificity for PZA resistance against genotypic DST, with one study (Driesen: TP 14, FN 0, TN 7; sensitivity 1.00 [0.77, 1.00], specificity 1.00 [0.59, 1.00]). Each row gives a study's TP, FP, FN and TN counts and sensitivity and specificity with 95% CI, plotted as squares with CI lines on 0–1 scales.",
